# 자동 정리 (하루 1회, livemax-cleanup.timer). ionice -c3 + nice 19 로 송출 방해 없음
[Unit]
Description=LiveMax daily cleanup (derived/temporary files only)

[Service]
Type=oneshot
User=livemax
Group=livemax
WorkingDirectory=@LIVEMAX_HOME@
Environment=LIVEMAX_HOME=@LIVEMAX_HOME@ PYTHONPATH=@LIVEMAX_HOME@/src PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1
ExecStart=@LIVEMAX_HOME@/venv/bin/python -m livemax.cleanup
IOSchedulingClass=idle
Nice=19
PrivateTmp=yes
ProtectHome=yes
